{"kind":"table","sheet":"Field Guide","address":"A1:B17","rows":17,"cols":2,"values":[["Field","What to provide or review"],["itemno","Required. Sara inventory item number. Keep as text."],["product link","Required. Exact product page from Amazon, Flipkart, Reliance, Pai, LG, Vijay Sales or Bosch."],["title / brand","Optional matching hints. The scraper extracts the source title and brand."],["description / image url","Generated source facts. Verify the exact product and permission to use images."],["price / stock","Sara Stores' selling price and inventory. Source prices/availability remain in separate columns. The scraper does not change Sara prices or stock."],["offerid / Sara product link","Stable Sara SKU and canonical Sara product page. A retailer's product ID is not the offer ID."],["gtin","Product box barcode (EAN/UPC/GTIN), stored as text to preserve leading zeros. Checksum and exact-variant checks are required."],["manufacturer mpn","Explicit manufacturer part number. Never substitute ASIN, Flipkart FSN, internal SKU or an unverified model reference."],["verified manufacturer/supplier source","Fill after checking packaging, manufacturer records or an authorised supplier. The original extracted evidence remains available separately."],["currency / condition / availability","Merchant listing values must match Sara's product and inventory. Unknown source values remain blank."],["additional image urls","Additional source product images. Review usage rights and exact variant."],["source price / currency / availability","Retailer observations, not Sara's selling price or stock count."],["model reference","Research hint only. Does not automatically qualify as MPN."],["fetched at / verification status / issues","Extraction time, remaining review and missing/conflicting data."],["Repeat uploads","Completed enrichment item numbers are skipped. Failed fetches can be retried. Run stores evidence, not Google listings."],["Merchant account setup","Claim the Sara website and configure accurate shipping/returns and the intended India/English data source before approving a Google submission."]]}
